		4	STREAM	EID_2000_rw_0050_BOOKW010_Y	0.5				0	26	Elimine essas menores o mais rápido que puder!
1556		2	STREAM	EID_2000_rw_0060_VILLNMW_Y	0.5				0	108	Yaaaah!
1557		2	STREAM	EID_2000_rw_0070_VILLNMW_Y	0.5				0	108	Afaste-se!
